## trucking-companies-register-2026-10.csv

- FMCSA Company Census File, data.transportation.gov dataset az4n-8mr2 (https://data.transportation.gov/Trucking-and-Motorcoaches/Company-Census-File/az4n-8mr2), rows updated 2026-10-03, read with SoQL aggregate queries on 2026-10-04. All fields are published as text; MCS-150 and add dates are `YYYYMMDD` strings.
- FMCSA operating authority data on data.transportation.gov: the legacy Licensing and Insurance carrier file "Carrier - All With History" (dataset 6eyk-hxee, https://data.transportation.gov/Trucking-and-Motorcoaches/Carrier-All-With-History/6eyk-hxee), last refreshed 2026-05-14 and no longer updated after FMCSA moved registration to Motus, and "Motus Carrier - All With History" (dataset inys-ebih, https://data.transportation.gov/Trucking-and-Motorcoaches/Motus-Carrier-All-With-History/inys-ebih), rows updated 2026-10-03. Read on 2026-10-04 as docket number, business address state and country, bond flag and authority status only.
- US Census Bureau Vintage 2025 state population estimates (July 1, 2025), via FRED, for the rate per 100,000 residents.

